<mxCell id="p0b1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:29.0px&quot;&gt;그림 2-2. BGP 경로가 줄어드는 지점 : 광고 V → 설치 1 을 V → V 로&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#201E1F;strokeColor=#201E1F;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#F7F3EC;fontSize=24.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0b2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;Storage leaf VTEP V개 (= Storage 랙 수 × 2) 가 VIP 를 광고해도 단계마다 경로가 떨어짐. 단계별 설정 1개씩으로 V개 유지&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECDDB9;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="62" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
